<p>Thame huwe Hassan ko yeh Zainab ne di sada hai hai yeh kya hua,<br>
Muh se nikal raha hai jigar wa Mohammeda hai hai yeh kya hua.</p>

<p>Kis tarah ho raha hai badan neelgu'n tamam, kisne kiya yeh kaam,<br>
Kis dushmane Khuda ne sam e pur dagha diya, hai hai yeh kya hua.</p>

<p>Bulwaye jald are koi bhai Hussain ko taqeer ab na ho,<br>
Bhai pe apne bhai shifa ki padhe'n dua, hai hai yeh kya hua.</p>

<p>Pur hogaya kaleje ke tukdon se jo lagan, ghabrayegi behen,<br>
Chillayi Ya Ali chamane Fatima luta hai hai yeh kya hua.</p>

<p>Be jurm jaan Syyeda gosha nasheen ki li, fariyaad ya Ali,<br>
Bhai ne mere kisko sataya tha Ya Khuda, hai hai yeh kya hua.</p>

<p>Sunkar Hussain ibne Ali jangaza khabar, aaye barehna sar,<br>
Dekha jo haal bhai ka be saaqta kaha, hai hai yeh kya hua.</p>

<p>Yeh Fatima ke laal pe kaisa hua sitam, kyukar kahe na hum,<br>
Lanat Khuda ki uspe jo bayes ho qatl ka, hai hai yeh kya hua...</p>